// IncomeDefaults Form prefill from the rate catalog (UX only; the server re-validates every write). Withholdings are derived (ADR-0008), so there is no rate to suggest: the form shows `previewIncomeWithholdings`. **0.12.0 (WH-11, ADR-0008 amendment):** the four `*_withholding_*` fields are removed and `last_used` is required.
